    {
      "fileName": "poisoner-dedication.json",
      "id": "y7DDs03GtDnmhxFp",
      "name": "Poisoner Dedication",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "y7DDs03GtDnmhxFp",
        "folder": "0CCvmxP0UKs17wzC",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Poisoner Dedication",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You make a point of always having a few toxins near at hand—you never know when some arsenic or the like might prove useful. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.Jkl5KOZih7MoMqAJ#advanced-alchemy-benefits]{advanced alchemy benefits}. You can use advanced alchemy to create four alchemical poison consumables each day. You remember alchemical poison formulas and don't need a formula book for them.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.HvbDEgCsLbzuMRiR]{Poisoner}</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "trained in Crafting"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
